====================================================================================================
INTERPRETATION RULES
====================================================================================================
1. Use Medium_4Google as the cleanest external benchmark first.
2. Report BOTH Low diagonal variants until the exact paper AP labels are confirmed.
3. Report BOTH High short-wall variants until the exact Linksys subset is confirmed.
4. Do not tune max_features on this dataset: F=0.7 was frozen from the original study.
5. Primary accuracy metric here is TRUE 2D RMSE in metres.
6. Stratified-row CV and RP-grouped CV answer different research questions; never mix them.
7. Cross-day results test temporal robustness and are especially useful for the paper.
8. The script snaps Day-1 y=8.1 m to the canonical y=8.0 m top row so the same physical RP is grouped consistently.

